 "snippet": "    // L7 — THE MOAT. One gate, plugged. Crossing on foot costs everything.\n    make(\n      7,\n      [\n        king(6, 8), pawn(7, 6), bishop(1, 6), knight(5, 2),\n      ],\n      {\n        ...FLEE,\n        moveLimit: 10,\n        hazards: [X(1, 4), X(2, 4), X(3, 4), X(4, 4), X(5, 4), X(6, 4), X(8, 4), X(7, 3), X(7, 5), X(5, 8), X(8, 8), X(4, 7), X(8, 7), X(5, 6)],\n        kingPen: ['f7', 'g7', 'f8', 'g8'],\n      },\n    ),"
